# Visual Prototyping Board

Interactive prototyping tool with a component bar and a customisable whiteboard.

## Features

- Drag text, images and carousels onto a canvas
- Animations
- Export to PDF or HTML

## Tech Stack

- HTML/CSS

## Getting Started

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ghostland-dev/scrum-figma-clone.git
cd scrum-figma-clone
cd .vite/deps
# open index.html in your browser, or serve the folder:
npx serve .
```

